# Scene1-2-13

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐2-13
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『シャワールーム』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和往常一样走进淋浴房，<br>没想到遇见了亚里沙。|#0102Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃。|#0102Adv13_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（已经习惯被她摆臭脸了）|#0102Adv13_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙，跟我聊一……|#0102Adv13_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:我跟你没话好说！<br>不是说了我干不了吗！|#0102Adv13_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:你就不想离开这里吗！？|#0102Adv13_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然想啊！|#0102Adv13_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:饭难吃得要死，房间又黑又潮湿，<br>一天到晚被人监视，搞不好就要被杀死。|#0102Adv13_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我也在以自己的方法寻找出路啊。|#0102Adv13_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你找到什么方法了吗？|#0102Adv13_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……<br>这个嘛，就，慢慢来吧。|#0102Adv13_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Alisa Loop:false ScenePositionX:20

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙慢慢地挪动步子，<br>想从门口逃走。|#0102Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么说你做不到，<br>明明你的魔法那么强大。|#0102Adv13_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:能凭空生火简直就是奇迹。<br>你的魔法一定可以——！|#0102Adv13_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR2,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……<br>我的魔法你又懂什么！|#0102Adv13_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根本就是你一厢情愿，我看你什么都不懂！<br>这破魔法我才不想要呢！！|#0102Adv13_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对怒火朝天的亚里沙，<br>艾玛吓得有些退缩，但她坚持下来了。|#0102Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我很羡慕你啊！<br>因为我什么都没有！|#0102Adv13_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Angle01/Option_ArmL+,ArmL11,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你那么想要，那我就给你！|#0102Adv13_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL8,ArmR1

; 放たれた炎の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_46 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……！|#0102Adv13_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙或许想要吓一吓艾玛，<br>于是举起手对着她，从掌心放出火焰。|#0102Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那火焰比想像中要猛烈。<br>它直奔艾玛，烧焦了她的衣服。|#0102Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛顿时惊慌失措，<br>但亚里沙的脸色比她惨白得多。|#0102Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL4,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂你没事吧！？|#0102Adv13_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙急忙跑了过去，<br>扭开淋浴的龙头放水。|#0102Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; シャワー音
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_2_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:130_1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛衣服上的火焰<br>很快就被水给冲灭了。|#0102Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和亚里沙<br>都被淋得浑身湿透。|#0102Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm BgmPath:Ambi_2_1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙好像感觉有些呼吸不畅，于是便摘下了口罩。<br>她皱起眉，一脸担心地盯着艾玛。|#0102Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉。你，没受伤吧……？|#0102Adv13_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。我没事……|#0102Adv13_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，我还是第一次见到<br>　亚里沙的真面目……）|#0102Adv13_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.8 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:40,30 AppearanceAndTransition:130_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛目不转睛地盯着<br>亚里沙的脸。|#0102Adv13_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……接近我就是这个下场，<br>别再缠着我了。|#0102Adv13_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我不听。<br>我需要你。|#0102Adv13_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙，不是才吃了亏，还不长记性吗。<br>我的魔法很危险的。|#0102Adv13_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一点也不可怕，我只是有点吃惊。<br>而且你还来救我，我好开心。|#0102Adv13_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算我遇到危险，<br>你也一定会来救我的吧？|#0102Adv13_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就没问题了！<br>你的魔法一点都不可怕！|#0102Adv13_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0102Adv13_Alisa014| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:热气球马上就要完成了，<br>大概明后天的样子。|#0102Adv13_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:计划执行的那天，我会等你的。<br>因为只有你能做到。|#0102Adv13_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……随你怎么说吧。|#0102Adv13_Alisa015| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是她到目前为止最无力的一次拒绝。|#0102Adv13_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（接下来只能相信亚里沙了）|#0102Adv13_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

